===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

{{tlb|en|US|Canada}}
# The process of becoming older or more [[mature]].
# The [[deliberate]] process of making something (such as an [[antique]]) appear (or, in science fiction, become) older than it is.
# {{lb|en|gerontology}} The accumulation of damage to [[macromolecule]]s, [[cell]]s, [[tissue]]s and [[organ]]s with the passage of time; the progressing [[loss]] of [[health]], mobility, [[vibrancy]] and body [[functionality]], resulting in biological [[death]].
#: {{syn|en|senescence}}
# [[wear|Wear]], [[wear and tear]].

